{"n":72,"name":"Al-Jinn","nameAr":"الجن","meaning":"The Jinn","ayahs":28,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":29,"ar":"قُلْ أُوحِىَ إِلَىَّ أَنَّهُ ٱسْتَمَعَ نَفَرٌ مِّنَ ٱلْجِنِّ فَقَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّا سَمِعْنَا قُرْءَانًا عَجَبًا","en":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"It has been revealed to me that a group of the jinn listened and said, 'Indeed, we have heard an amazing Qur’ān [i.e., recitation].","w":[{"ar":"قُلْ","tr":"qul","en":"Say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"أُوحِىَ","tr":"ūḥiya","en":"It has been revealed","root":"وحي","lem":"أَوْحَى"},{"ar":"إِلَىَّ","tr":"ilayya","en":"to me"},{"ar":"أَنَّهُ","tr":"annahu","en":"that"},{"ar":"ٱسْتَمَعَ","tr":"is'tamaʿa","en":"listened","root":"سمع","lem":"اسْتَمَعَ"},{"ar":"نَفَرٌۭ","tr":"nafarun","en":"a group","root":"نفر","lem":"نَفَر"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"of"},{"ar":"ٱلْجِنِّ","tr":"l-jini","en":"the jinn","root":"جنن","lem":"جِنّ"},{"ar":"فَقَالُوٓا۟","tr":"faqālū","en":"and they said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, we"},{"ar":"سَمِعْنَا","tr":"samiʿ'nā","en":"heard","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"قُرْءَانًا","tr":"qur'ānan","en":"a Quran","root":"قرأ","lem":"قُرْءان"},{"ar":"عَجَبًۭا","tr":"ʿajaban","en":"amazing","root":"عجب","lem":"عَجَب"}]},{"n":2,"juz":29,"ar":"يَهْدِىٓ إِلَى ٱلرُّشْدِ فَـَٔامَنَّا بِهِۦ ۖ وَلَن نُّشْرِكَ بِرَبِّنَآ أَحَدًا","en":"It guides to the right course, and we have believed in it. And we will never associate with our Lord anyone.","w":[{"ar":"يَهْدِىٓ","tr":"yahdī","en":"It guides","root":"هدي","lem":"هَدَى"},{"ar":"إِلَى","tr":"ilā","en":"to"},{"ar":"ٱلرُّشْدِ","tr":"l-rush'di","en":"the right way","root":"رشد","lem":"رُشْد"},{"ar":"فَـَٔامَنَّا","tr":"faāmannā","en":"so we believe","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"بِهِۦ ۖ","tr":"bihi","en":"in it"},{"ar":"وَلَن","tr":"walan","en":"and never"},{"ar":"نُّشْرِكَ","tr":"nush'rika","en":"we will associate","root":"شرك","lem":"أَشْرَكَ"},{"ar":"بِرَبِّنَآ","tr":"birabbinā","en":"with our Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"أَحَدًۭا","tr":"aḥadan","en":"anyone","root":"أحد","lem":"أَحَد"}]},{"n":3,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّهُۥ تَعَـٰلَىٰ جَدُّ رَبِّنَا مَا ٱتَّخَذَ صَـٰحِبَةً وَلَا وَلَدًا","en":"And [it teaches] that exalted is the nobleness of our Lord; He has not taken a wife or a son","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّهُۥ","tr":"wa-annahu","en":"And that He "},{"ar":"تَعَـٰلَىٰ","tr":"taʿālā","en":"Exalted is","root":"علو","lem":"تَعالَى"},{"ar":"جَدُّ","tr":"jaddu","en":"(the) Majesty","root":"جدد","lem":"جَدّ"},{"ar":"رَبِّنَا","tr":"rabbinā","en":"(of) our Lord ","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"not"},{"ar":"ٱتَّخَذَ","tr":"ittakhadha","en":"He has taken","root":"أخذ","lem":"اتَّخَذَ"},{"ar":"صَـٰحِبَةًۭ","tr":"ṣāḥibatan","en":"a wife","root":"صحب","lem":"صاحِبَة"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"وَلَدًۭا","tr":"waladan","en":"a son","root":"ولد","lem":"وَلَد"}]},{"n":4,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّهُۥ كَانَ يَقُولُ سَفِيهُنَا عَلَى ٱللَّهِ شَطَطًا","en":"And that our foolish one [i.e., Iblees] has been saying about Allāh an excessive transgression.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّهُۥ","tr":"wa-annahu","en":"And that he"},{"ar":"كَانَ","tr":"kāna","en":"used to","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"يَقُولُ","tr":"yaqūlu","en":"speak ","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"سَفِيهُنَا","tr":"safīhunā","en":"the foolish among us","root":"سفه","lem":"سَفِيه"},{"ar":"عَلَى","tr":"ʿalā","en":"against"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"شَطَطًۭا","tr":"shaṭaṭan","en":"an excessive transgression","root":"شطط","lem":"شَطَط"}]},{"n":5,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّا ظَنَنَّآ أَن لَّن تَقُولَ ٱلْإِنسُ وَٱلْجِنُّ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ كَذِبًا","en":"And we had thought that mankind and the jinn would never speak about Allāh a lie.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّا","tr":"wa-annā","en":"And that we"},{"ar":"ظَنَنَّآ","tr":"ẓanannā","en":"thought","root":"ظنن","lem":"ظَنَّ"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"لَّن","tr":"lan","en":"never"},{"ar":"تَقُولَ","tr":"taqūla","en":"will say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْإِنسُ","tr":"l-insu","en":"the men","root":"أنس","lem":"إِنس"},{"ar":"وَٱلْجِنُّ","tr":"wal-jinu","en":"and the jinn","root":"جنن","lem":"جِنّ"},{"ar":"عَلَى","tr":"ʿalā","en":"against"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"كَذِبًۭا","tr":"kadhiban","en":"any lie","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذِب"}]},{"n":6,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّهُۥ كَانَ رِجَالٌ مِّنَ ٱلْإِنسِ يَعُوذُونَ بِرِجَالٍ مِّنَ ٱلْجِنِّ فَزَادُوهُمْ رَهَقًا","en":"And there were men from mankind who sought refuge in men from the jinn, so they [only] increased them in burden [i.e., sin].","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّهُۥ","tr":"wa-annahu","en":"And that"},{"ar":"كَانَ","tr":"kāna","en":"(there) were","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"رِجَالٌۭ","tr":"rijālun","en":"men","root":"رجل","lem":"رِجال"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"among"},{"ar":"ٱلْإِنسِ","tr":"l-insi","en":"mankind","root":"أنس","lem":"إِنس"},{"ar":"يَعُوذُونَ","tr":"yaʿūdhūna","en":"who sought refuge","root":"عوذ","lem":"عُذْ"},{"ar":"بِرِجَالٍۢ","tr":"birijālin","en":"in (the) men","root":"رجل","lem":"رِجال"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"from"},{"ar":"ٱلْجِنِّ","tr":"l-jini","en":"the jinn","root":"جنن","lem":"جِنّ"},{"ar":"فَزَادُوهُمْ","tr":"fazādūhum","en":"so they increased them","root":"زيد","lem":"زادَ"},{"ar":"رَهَقًۭا","tr":"rahaqan","en":"(in) burden","root":"رهق","lem":"رَهَق"}]},{"n":7,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّهُمْ ظَنُّوا۟ كَمَا ظَنَنتُمْ أَن لَّن يَبْعَثَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدًا","en":"And they had thought, as you thought, that Allāh would never send anyone [as a messenger].","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّهُمْ","tr":"wa-annahum","en":"And that they"},{"ar":"ظَنُّوا۟","tr":"ẓannū","en":"thought","root":"ظنن","lem":"ظَنَّ"},{"ar":"كَمَا","tr":"kamā","en":"as"},{"ar":"ظَنَنتُمْ","tr":"ẓanantum","en":"you thought","root":"ظنن","lem":"ظَنَّ"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"لَّن","tr":"lan","en":"never"},{"ar":"يَبْعَثَ","tr":"yabʿatha","en":"will raise","root":"بعث","lem":"بَعَثَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"أَحَدًۭا","tr":"aḥadan","en":"anyone","root":"أحد","lem":"أَحَد"}]},{"n":8,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّا لَمَسْنَا ٱلسَّمَآءَ فَوَجَدْنَـٰهَا مُلِئَتْ حَرَسًا شَدِيدًا وَشُهُبًا","en":"And we have sought [to reach] the heaven but found it filled with powerful guards and burning flames.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّا","tr":"wa-annā","en":"And that we"},{"ar":"لَمَسْنَا","tr":"lamasnā","en":"sought to touch","root":"لمس","lem":"لَمَسُ"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءَ","tr":"l-samāa","en":"the heaven","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"فَوَجَدْنَـٰهَا","tr":"fawajadnāhā","en":"but we found it","root":"وجد","lem":"وَجَدَ"},{"ar":"مُلِئَتْ","tr":"muli-at","en":"filled (with)","root":"ملأ","lem":"مُلِئَتْ"},{"ar":"حَرَسًۭا","tr":"ḥarasan","en":"guards","root":"حرس","lem":"حَرَس"},{"ar":"شَدِيدًۭا","tr":"shadīdan","en":"severe","root":"شدد","lem":"شَدِيد"},{"ar":"وَشُهُبًۭا","tr":"washuhuban","en":"and flaming fires","root":"شهب","lem":"شُهُب"}]},{"n":9,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّا كُنَّا نَقْعُدُ مِنْهَا مَقَـٰعِدَ لِلسَّمْعِ ۖ فَمَن يَسْتَمِعِ ٱلْـَٔانَ يَجِدْ لَهُۥ شِهَابًا رَّصَدًا","en":"And we used to sit therein in positions for hearing, but whoever listens now will find a burning flame lying in wait for him.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّا","tr":"wa-annā","en":"And that we"},{"ar":"كُنَّا","tr":"kunnā","en":"used to","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"نَقْعُدُ","tr":"naqʿudu","en":"sit","root":"قعد","lem":"قَعَدَ"},{"ar":"مِنْهَا","tr":"min'hā","en":"there in"},{"ar":"مَقَـٰعِدَ","tr":"maqāʿida","en":"positions","root":"قعد","lem":"مَقْعَد"},{"ar":"لِلسَّمْعِ ۖ","tr":"lilssamʿi","en":"for hearing","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمْع"},{"ar":"فَمَن","tr":"faman","en":"but (he) who"},{"ar":"يَسْتَمِعِ","tr":"yastamiʿi","en":"listens","root":"سمع","lem":"اسْتَمَعَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْـَٔانَ","tr":"l-āna","en":"now","root":"أون","lem":"آن"},{"ar":"يَجِدْ","tr":"yajid","en":"will find","root":"وجد","lem":"وَجَدَ"},{"ar":"لَهُۥ","tr":"lahu","en":"for him"},{"ar":"شِهَابًۭا","tr":"shihāban","en":"a flaming fire","root":"شهب","lem":"شِهاب"},{"ar":"رَّصَدًۭا","tr":"raṣadan","en":"waiting","root":"رصد","lem":"رَصَد"}]},{"n":10,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّا لَا نَدْرِىٓ أَشَرٌّ أُرِيدَ بِمَن فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ أَمْ أَرَادَ بِهِمْ رَبُّهُمْ رَشَدًا","en":"And we do not know [therefore] whether evil is intended for those on earth or whether their Lord intends for them a right course.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّا","tr":"wa-annā","en":"And that we "},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"not"},{"ar":"نَدْرِىٓ","tr":"nadrī","en":"we know","root":"دري","lem":"تَدْرِي"},{"ar":"أَشَرٌّ","tr":"asharrun","en":"whether evil","root":"شرر","lem":"شَرّ"},{"ar":"أُرِيدَ","tr":"urīda","en":"is intended","root":"رود","lem":"أَرادَ"},{"ar":"بِمَن","tr":"biman","en":"for (those) who"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(are) in"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"l-arḍi","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"أَمْ","tr":"am","en":"or"},{"ar":"أَرَادَ","tr":"arāda","en":"intends","root":"رود","lem":"أَرادَ"},{"ar":"بِهِمْ","tr":"bihim","en":"for them"},{"ar":"رَبُّهُمْ","tr":"rabbuhum","en":"their Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"رَشَدًۭا","tr":"rashadan","en":"a right path","root":"رشد","lem":"رَشَد"}]},{"n":11,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّا مِنَّا ٱلصَّـٰلِحُونَ وَمِنَّا دُونَ ذَٰلِكَ ۖ كُنَّا طَرَآئِقَ قِدَدًا","en":"And among us are the righteous, and among us are [others] not so; we were [of] divided ways.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّا","tr":"wa-annā","en":"And that [we]"},{"ar":"مِنَّا","tr":"minnā","en":"among us"},{"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحُونَ","tr":"l-ṣāliḥūna","en":"(are) the righteous","root":"صلح","lem":"صالِح"},{"ar":"وَمِنَّا","tr":"waminnā","en":"and among us"},{"ar":"دُونَ","tr":"dūna","en":"(are) other than","root":"دون","lem":"دُون"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ ۖ","tr":"dhālika","en":"that"},{"ar":"كُنَّا","tr":"kunnā","en":"We","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"طَرَآئِقَ","tr":"ṭarāiqa","en":"(are on) ways","root":"طرق","lem":"طَرِيقَة"},{"ar":"قِدَدًۭا","tr":"qidadan","en":"different","root":"قدد","lem":"قِدَد"}]},{"n":12,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّا ظَنَنَّآ أَن لَّن نُّعْجِزَ ٱللَّهَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَلَن نُّعْجِزَهُۥ هَرَبًا","en":"And we have become certain that we will never cause failure to Allāh upon earth, nor can we escape Him by flight.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّا","tr":"wa-annā","en":"And that we"},{"ar":"ظَنَنَّآ","tr":"ẓanannā","en":"[we] have become certain","root":"ظنن","lem":"ظَنَّ"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"لَّن","tr":"lan","en":"never"},{"ar":"نُّعْجِزَ","tr":"nuʿ'jiza","en":"we will cause failure","root":"عجز","lem":"يُعْجِزَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"(to) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"l-arḍi","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"وَلَن","tr":"walan","en":"and never"},{"ar":"نُّعْجِزَهُۥ","tr":"nuʿ'jizahu","en":"we can escape Him","root":"عجز","lem":"يُعْجِزَ"},{"ar":"هَرَبًۭا","tr":"haraban","en":"(by) flight","root":"هرب","lem":"هَرَب"}]},{"n":13,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّا لَمَّا سَمِعْنَا ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ ءَامَنَّا بِهِۦ ۖ فَمَن يُؤْمِنۢ بِرَبِّهِۦ فَلَا يَخَافُ بَخْسًا وَلَا رَهَقًا","en":"And when we heard the guidance [i.e., the Qur’ān], we believed in it. And whoever believes in his Lord will not fear deprivation or burden.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّا","tr":"wa-annā","en":"And that [we]"},{"ar":"لَمَّا","tr":"lammā","en":"when"},{"ar":"سَمِعْنَا","tr":"samiʿ'nā","en":"we heard","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِعَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","tr":"l-hudā","en":"the Guidance","root":"هدي","lem":"هُدًى"},{"ar":"ءَامَنَّا","tr":"āmannā","en":"we believed","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"بِهِۦ ۖ","tr":"bihi","en":"in it"},{"ar":"فَمَن","tr":"faman","en":"And whoever"},{"ar":"يُؤْمِنۢ","tr":"yu'min","en":"believes","root":"أمن","lem":"آمَنَ"},{"ar":"بِرَبِّهِۦ","tr":"birabbihi","en":"in his Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"فَلَا","tr":"falā","en":"then not"},{"ar":"يَخَافُ","tr":"yakhāfu","en":"he will fear","root":"خوف","lem":"خافَ"},{"ar":"بَخْسًۭا","tr":"bakhsan","en":"any loss","root":"بخس","lem":"بَخْس"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"رَهَقًۭا","tr":"rahaqan","en":"any burden","root":"رهق","lem":"رَهَق"}]},{"n":14,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّا مِنَّا ٱلْمُسْلِمُونَ وَمِنَّا ٱلْقَـٰسِطُونَ ۖ فَمَنْ أَسْلَمَ فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ تَحَرَّوْا۟ رَشَدًا","en":"And among us are Muslims [in submission to Allāh], and among us are the unjust. And whoever has become Muslim - those have sought out the right course.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّا","tr":"wa-annā","en":"And that we"},{"ar":"مِنَّا","tr":"minnā","en":"among us"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُسْلِمُونَ","tr":"l-mus'limūna","en":"(are) Muslims","root":"سلم","lem":"مُسْلِم"},{"ar":"وَمِنَّا","tr":"waminnā","en":"and among us"},{"ar":"ٱلْقَـٰسِطُونَ ۖ","tr":"l-qāsiṭūna","en":"(are) unjust","root":"قسط","lem":"قاسِط"},{"ar":"فَمَنْ","tr":"faman","en":"And whoever"},{"ar":"أَسْلَمَ","tr":"aslama","en":"submits","root":"سلم","lem":"أَسْلَمَ"},{"ar":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","tr":"fa-ulāika","en":"then those"},{"ar":"تَحَرَّوْا۟","tr":"taḥarraw","en":"have sought","root":"حري","lem":"تَحَرَّ"},{"ar":"رَشَدًۭا","tr":"rashadan","en":"(the) right path","root":"رشد","lem":"رَشَد"}]},{"n":15,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَمَّا ٱلْقَـٰسِطُونَ فَكَانُوا۟ لِجَهَنَّمَ حَطَبًا","en":"But as for the unjust, they will be, for Hell, firewood.'","w":[{"ar":"وَأَمَّا","tr":"wa-ammā","en":"And as for"},{"ar":"ٱلْقَـٰسِطُونَ","tr":"l-qāsiṭūna","en":"the unjust","root":"قسط","lem":"قاسِط"},{"ar":"فَكَانُوا۟","tr":"fakānū","en":"they will be","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"لِجَهَنَّمَ","tr":"lijahannama","en":"for Hell"},{"ar":"حَطَبًۭا","tr":"ḥaṭaban","en":"firewood","root":"حطب","lem":"حَطَب"}]},{"n":16,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَلَّوِ ٱسْتَقَـٰمُوا۟ عَلَى ٱلطَّرِيقَةِ لَأَسْقَيْنَـٰهُم مَّآءً غَدَقًا","en":"And [Allāh revealed] that if they had remained straight on the way, We would have given them abundant rain [i.e., provision].","w":[{"ar":"وَأَلَّوِ","tr":"wa-allawi","en":"And that if"},{"ar":"ٱسْتَقَـٰمُوا۟","tr":"is'taqāmū","en":"they had remained","root":"قوم","lem":"اسْتَقامُ"},{"ar":"عَلَى","tr":"ʿalā","en":"on"},{"ar":"ٱلطَّرِيقَةِ","tr":"l-ṭarīqati","en":"the Way","root":"طرق","lem":"طَرِيقَة"},{"ar":"لَأَسْقَيْنَـٰهُم","tr":"la-asqaynāhum","en":"surely We (would) have given them to drink","root":"سقي","lem":"أَسْقَيْ"},{"ar":"مَّآءً","tr":"māan","en":"water","root":"موه","lem":"ماء"},{"ar":"غَدَقًۭا","tr":"ghadaqan","en":"(in) abundance","root":"غدق","lem":"غَدَق"}]},{"n":17,"juz":29,"ar":"لِّنَفْتِنَهُمْ فِيهِ ۚ وَمَن يُعْرِضْ عَن ذِكْرِ رَبِّهِۦ يَسْلُكْهُ عَذَابًا صَعَدًا","en":"So We might test them therein. And whoever turns away from the remembrance of his Lord He will put into arduous punishment.","w":[{"ar":"لِّنَفْتِنَهُمْ","tr":"linaftinahum","en":"That We might test them","root":"فتن","lem":"فَتَنُ"},{"ar":"فِيهِ ۚ","tr":"fīhi","en":"therein"},{"ar":"وَمَن","tr":"waman","en":"And whoever"},{"ar":"يُعْرِضْ","tr":"yuʿ'riḍ","en":"turns away","root":"عرض","lem":"أَعْرَضَ"},{"ar":"عَن","tr":"ʿan","en":"from"},{"ar":"ذِكْرِ","tr":"dhik'ri","en":"the Remembrance","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذِكْر"},{"ar":"رَبِّهِۦ","tr":"rabbihi","en":"(of) his Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"يَسْلُكْهُ","tr":"yasluk'hu","en":"He will make him enter","root":"سلك","lem":"سَلَكَ"},{"ar":"عَذَابًۭا","tr":"ʿadhāban","en":"a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"صَعَدًۭا","tr":"ṣaʿadan","en":"severe","root":"صعد","lem":"صَعَد"}]},{"n":18,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّ ٱلْمَسَـٰجِدَ لِلَّهِ فَلَا تَدْعُوا۟ مَعَ ٱللَّهِ أَحَدًا","en":"And [He revealed] that the masjids are for Allāh, so do not invoke with Allāh anyone.","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّ","tr":"wa-anna","en":"And that"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَسَـٰجِدَ","tr":"l-masājida","en":"the masjids","root":"سجد","lem":"مَسْجِد"},{"ar":"لِلَّهِ","tr":"lillahi","en":"(are) for Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"فَلَا","tr":"falā","en":"so (do) not"},{"ar":"تَدْعُوا۟","tr":"tadʿū","en":"call","root":"دعو","lem":"دَعا"},{"ar":"مَعَ","tr":"maʿa","en":"with"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"أَحَدًۭا","tr":"aḥadan","en":"anyone","root":"أحد","lem":"أَحَد"}]},{"n":19,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَنَّهُۥ لَمَّا قَامَ عَبْدُ ٱللَّهِ يَدْعُوهُ كَادُوا۟ يَكُونُونَ عَلَيْهِ لِبَدًا","en":"And that when the Servant [i.e., Prophet] of Allāh stood up supplicating Him, they almost became about him a compacted mass.\"","w":[{"ar":"وَأَنَّهُۥ","tr":"wa-annahu","en":"And that"},{"ar":"لَمَّا","tr":"lammā","en":"when"},{"ar":"قَامَ","tr":"qāma","en":"stood up","root":"قوم","lem":"قامَ"},{"ar":"عَبْدُ","tr":"ʿabdu","en":"(the) slave","root":"عبد","lem":"عَبْد"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"يَدْعُوهُ","tr":"yadʿūhu","en":"calling (upon) Him","root":"دعو","lem":"دَعا"},{"ar":"كَادُوا۟","tr":"kādū","en":"they almost","root":"كود","lem":"كادَ"},{"ar":"يَكُونُونَ","tr":"yakūnūna","en":"became","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","tr":"ʿalayhi","en":"around him"},{"ar":"لِبَدًۭا","tr":"libadan","en":"a compacted mass","root":"لبد","lem":"لِبَد"}]},{"n":20,"juz":29,"ar":"قُلْ إِنَّمَآ أَدْعُوا۟ رَبِّى وَلَآ أُشْرِكُ بِهِۦٓ أَحَدًا","en":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"I only invoke my Lord and do not associate with Him anyone.\"","w":[{"ar":"قُلْ","tr":"qul","en":"Say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"إِنَّمَآ","tr":"innamā","en":"Only"},{"ar":"أَدْعُوا۟","tr":"adʿū","en":"I call upon","root":"دعو","lem":"دَعا"},{"ar":"رَبِّى","tr":"rabbī","en":"my Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"وَلَآ","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"أُشْرِكُ","tr":"ush'riku","en":"I associate","root":"شرك","lem":"أَشْرَكَ"},{"ar":"بِهِۦٓ","tr":"bihi","en":"with Him"},{"ar":"أَحَدًۭا","tr":"aḥadan","en":"anyone","root":"أحد","lem":"أَحَد"}]},{"n":21,"juz":29,"ar":"قُلْ إِنِّى لَآ أَمْلِكُ لَكُمْ ضَرًّا وَلَا رَشَدًا","en":"Say, \"Indeed, I do not possess for you [the power of] harm or right direction.\"","w":[{"ar":"قُلْ","tr":"qul","en":"Say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"إِنِّى","tr":"innī","en":"Indeed, I"},{"ar":"لَآ","tr":"lā","en":"(do) not"},{"ar":"أَمْلِكُ","tr":"amliku","en":"possess","root":"ملك","lem":"مَلَكَتْ"},{"ar":"لَكُمْ","tr":"lakum","en":"for you"},{"ar":"ضَرًّۭا","tr":"ḍarran","en":"any harm","root":"ضرر","lem":"ضَرّ"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"رَشَدًۭا","tr":"rashadan","en":"right path","root":"رشد","lem":"رَشَد"}]},{"n":22,"juz":29,"ar":"قُلْ إِنِّى لَن يُجِيرَنِى مِنَ ٱللَّهِ أَحَدٌ وَلَنْ أَجِدَ مِن دُونِهِۦ مُلْتَحَدًا","en":"Say, \"Indeed, there will never protect me from Allāh anyone [if I should disobey], nor will I find in other than Him a refuge.","w":[{"ar":"قُلْ","tr":"qul","en":"Say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"إِنِّى","tr":"innī","en":"Indeed I"},{"ar":"لَن","tr":"lan","en":"never"},{"ar":"يُجِيرَنِى","tr":"yujīranī","en":"can protect me","root":"جور","lem":"يُجِيرُ"},{"ar":"مِنَ","tr":"mina","en":"from"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"أَحَدٌۭ","tr":"aḥadun","en":"anyone","root":"أحد","lem":"أَحَد"},{"ar":"وَلَنْ","tr":"walan","en":"and never"},{"ar":"أَجِدَ","tr":"ajida","en":"can I find","root":"وجد","lem":"وَجَدَ"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"دُونِهِۦ","tr":"dūnihi","en":"besides Him","root":"دون","lem":"دُون"},{"ar":"مُلْتَحَدًا","tr":"mul'taḥadan","en":"any refuge","root":"لحد","lem":"مُلْتَحَد"}]},{"n":23,"juz":29,"ar":"إِلَّا بَلَـٰغًا مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَرِسَـٰلَـٰتِهِۦ ۚ وَمَن يَعْصِ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ فَإِنَّ لَهُۥ نَارَ جَهَنَّمَ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَآ أَبَدًا","en":"But [I have for you] only notification from Allāh, and His messages.\" And whoever disobeys Allāh and His Messenger - then indeed, for him is the fire of Hell; they will abide therein forever.","w":[{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"But"},{"ar":"بَلَـٰغًۭا","tr":"balāghan","en":"(the) notification","root":"بلغ","lem":"بَلاغ"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"from"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَرِسَـٰلَـٰتِهِۦ ۚ","tr":"warisālātihi","en":"and His Messages","root":"رسل","lem":"رِسالَة"},{"ar":"وَمَن","tr":"waman","en":"And whoever"},{"ar":"يَعْصِ","tr":"yaʿṣi","en":"disobeys","root":"عصي","lem":"عَصا"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","tr":"warasūlahu","en":"and His Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"فَإِنَّ","tr":"fa-inna","en":"then indeed"},{"ar":"لَهُۥ","tr":"lahu","en":"for him"},{"ar":"نَارَ","tr":"nāra","en":"(is the) Fire","root":"نور","lem":"نار"},{"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","tr":"jahannama","en":"(of) Hell"},{"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","tr":"khālidīna","en":"(they will) abide","root":"خلد","lem":"خالِد"},{"ar":"فِيهَآ","tr":"fīhā","en":"therein"},{"ar":"أَبَدًا","tr":"abadan","en":"forever","root":"أبد","lem":"أَبَدًا"}]},{"n":24,"juz":29,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا رَأَوْا۟ مَا يُوعَدُونَ فَسَيَعْلَمُونَ مَنْ أَضْعَفُ نَاصِرًا وَأَقَلُّ عَدَدًا","en":"[The disbelievers continue] until, when they see that which they are promised, then they will know who is weaker in helpers and less in number.","w":[{"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","tr":"ḥattā","en":"Until"},{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"when"},{"ar":"رَأَوْا۟","tr":"ra-aw","en":"they see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"يُوعَدُونَ","tr":"yūʿadūna","en":"they are promised","root":"وعد","lem":"وَعَدَ"},{"ar":"فَسَيَعْلَمُونَ","tr":"fasayaʿlamūna","en":"then they will know","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"},{"ar":"مَنْ","tr":"man","en":"who"},{"ar":"أَضْعَفُ","tr":"aḍʿafu","en":"(is) weaker","root":"ضعف","lem":"أَضْعَف"},{"ar":"نَاصِرًۭا","tr":"nāṣiran","en":"(in) helpers","root":"نصر","lem":"ناصِر"},{"ar":"وَأَقَلُّ","tr":"wa-aqallu","en":"and fewer","root":"قلل","lem":"أَقَلّ"},{"ar":"عَدَدًۭا","tr":"ʿadadan","en":"(in) number","root":"عدد","lem":"عَدَد"}]},{"n":25,"juz":29,"ar":"قُلْ إِنْ أَدْرِىٓ أَقَرِيبٌ مَّا تُوعَدُونَ أَمْ يَجْعَلُ لَهُۥ رَبِّىٓ أَمَدًا","en":"Say, \"I do not know if what you are promised is near or if my Lord will grant for it a [long] period.\"","w":[{"ar":"قُلْ","tr":"qul","en":"Say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"إِنْ","tr":"in","en":"Not"},{"ar":"أَدْرِىٓ","tr":"adrī","en":"I know","root":"دري","lem":"تَدْرِي"},{"ar":"أَقَرِيبٌۭ","tr":"aqarībun","en":"whether is near","root":"قرب","lem":"قَرِيب"},{"ar":"مَّا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"تُوعَدُونَ","tr":"tūʿadūna","en":"you are promised","root":"وعد","lem":"وَعَدَ"},{"ar":"أَمْ","tr":"am","en":"or (whether)"},{"ar":"يَجْعَلُ","tr":"yajʿalu","en":"will appoint","root":"جعل","lem":"جَعَلَ"},{"ar":"لَهُۥ","tr":"lahu","en":"for it"},{"ar":"رَبِّىٓ","tr":"rabbī","en":"my Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"أَمَدًا","tr":"amadan","en":"a (distant) term","root":"أمد","lem":"أَمَد"}]},{"n":26,"juz":29,"ar":"عَـٰلِمُ ٱلْغَيْبِ فَلَا يُظْهِرُ عَلَىٰ غَيْبِهِۦٓ أَحَدًا","en":"[He is] Knower of the unseen, and He does not disclose His [knowledge of the] unseen to anyone","w":[{"ar":"عَـٰلِمُ","tr":"ʿālimu","en":"(The) All-Knower","root":"علم","lem":"عالِم"},{"ar":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","tr":"l-ghaybi","en":"(of) the unseen","root":"غيب","lem":"غَيْب"},{"ar":"فَلَا","tr":"falā","en":"so not"},{"ar":"يُظْهِرُ","tr":"yuẓ'hiru","en":"He reveals","root":"ظهر","lem":"أَظْهَرَ"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"from"},{"ar":"غَيْبِهِۦٓ","tr":"ghaybihi","en":"His unseen","root":"غيب","lem":"غَيْب"},{"ar":"أَحَدًا","tr":"aḥadan","en":"(to) anyone","root":"أحد","lem":"أَحَد"}]},{"n":27,"juz":29,"ar":"إِلَّا مَنِ ٱرْتَضَىٰ مِن رَّسُولٍ فَإِنَّهُۥ يَسْلُكُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ يَدَيْهِ وَمِنْ خَلْفِهِۦ رَصَدًا","en":"Except whom He has approved of messengers, and indeed, He sends before him [i.e., each messenger] and behind him observers","w":[{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"Except"},{"ar":"مَنِ","tr":"mani","en":"whom"},{"ar":"ٱرْتَضَىٰ","tr":"ir'taḍā","en":"He has approved","root":"رضو","lem":"ارْتَضَى"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"رَّسُولٍۢ","tr":"rasūlin","en":"a Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"فَإِنَّهُۥ","tr":"fa-innahu","en":"and indeed, He"},{"ar":"يَسْلُكُ","tr":"yasluku","en":"makes to march","root":"سلك","lem":"سَلَكَ"},{"ar":"مِنۢ","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"بَيْنِ","tr":"bayni","en":"before","root":"بين","lem":"بَيْن"},{"ar":"يَدَيْهِ","tr":"yadayhi","en":"him","root":"يدي","lem":"يَد"},{"ar":"وَمِنْ","tr":"wamin","en":"and from"},{"ar":"خَلْفِهِۦ","tr":"khalfihi","en":"behind him","root":"خلف","lem":"خَلْف"},{"ar":"رَصَدًۭا","tr":"raṣadan","en":"a guard","root":"رصد","lem":"رَصَد"}]},{"n":28,"juz":29,"ar":"لِّيَعْلَمَ أَن قَدْ أَبْلَغُوا۟ رِسَـٰلَـٰتِ رَبِّهِمْ وَأَحَاطَ بِمَا لَدَيْهِمْ وَأَحْصَىٰ كُلَّ شَىْءٍ عَدَدًۢا","en":"That he [i.e., Muḥammad (ﷺ)] may know that they have conveyed the messages of their Lord; and He has encompassed whatever is with them and has enumerated all things in number.","w":[{"ar":"لِّيَعْلَمَ","tr":"liyaʿlama","en":"That He may make evident","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِمَ"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"قَدْ","tr":"qad","en":"indeed"},{"ar":"أَبْلَغُوا۟","tr":"ablaghū","en":"they have conveyed","root":"بلغ","lem":"أَبْلَغُ"},{"ar":"رِسَـٰلَـٰتِ","tr":"risālāti","en":"(the) Messages","root":"رسل","lem":"رِسالَة"},{"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","tr":"rabbihim","en":"(of) their Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"وَأَحَاطَ","tr":"wa-aḥāṭa","en":"and He has encompassed","root":"حوط","lem":"أَحاطَ"},{"ar":"بِمَا","tr":"bimā","en":"what"},{"ar":"لَدَيْهِمْ","tr":"ladayhim","en":"(is) with them"},{"ar":"وَأَحْصَىٰ","tr":"wa-aḥṣā","en":"and He takes account","root":"حصي","lem":"أَحْصَى"},{"ar":"كُلَّ","tr":"kulla","en":"(of) all","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"شَىْءٍ","tr":"shayin","en":"things","root":"شيأ","lem":"شَىْء"},{"ar":"عَدَدًۢا","tr":"ʿadadan","en":"(in) number","root":"عدد","lem":"عَدَد"}]}]}